  {
   "id": 32,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -620,
    120
   ],
   "size": [
    620,
    980
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 0,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# MM3 Song Builder \u2014 how it works\n\n**Run** executes left to right. First run loads the model (~1 min). Listen on the Preview nodes; files land in `output/audio/mm3/`.\n\n## Generate (the opening)\n- **prompt** \u2014 the style: genre, BPM, key, mood, vocals, instruments, arrangement.\n- **lyrics** \u2014 section tags like `[verse]` / `[chorus]` must each sit on their own line (words on a tag line are dropped).\n- **audio_duration** \u2014 length of the opening. Keep it *shorter* than the lyrics can fill: a song cut off mid-performance can be extended; one that ends naturally cannot.\n- **seed** \u2014 reroll for a different take. `fixed` = cached, so re-running doesn't regenerate finished stages.\n\n## Extend stages (add sections)\n- Only stage 1 starts active. Select a purple stage and press **Ctrl+B** to enable/disable it. Bypassed stages pass the song through untouched.\n- **audio_duration** \u2014 how much NEW audio this stage adds.\n- **prompt / lyrics** \u2014 empty = keep the song's current text. To steer a section, supply lyrics as the *original sheet plus new verses appended*, and raise `cfg_scale` to 2\u20134 to push a style change through.\n- **continue_from_seconds** \u2014 `0` = continue from the end \u00b7 **negative** = back up that many seconds (`-5` redoes the last 5s) \u00b7 positive = jump to an absolute time from the start, discarding everything after it.\n- After a run each stage shows `section X \u2192 Y \u00b7 song is now Y` right on the node.\n- Don't like a section? Change that stage's seed and re-run \u2014 earlier stages stay cached.\n\n## Sampling knobs (defaults = the model's reference recipe)\n- **cfg_scale** 1.5 \u2014 how hard the text steers. Raise for style pivots; too high hurts naturalness.\n- **top_k** 50 \u00b7 **temperature** 1.0 \u2014 variety vs. safety.\n- **num_inference_steps** 30 \u2014 render quality; ~15 is a fast draft.\n\n## Files\n- `<seed>_take1` = the opening \u00b7 `<seed>_full` = the finished song \u00b7 `song_<seed>.mm3state` = the resumable state.\n- To keep growing a song later, open **MM3 - Resume saved song** and point it at the `.mm3state` \u2014 the audio file alone cannot be extended.\n- **\"Song already ended\" error** = the song reached a natural finish. Rewind into it (negative `continue_from_seconds`) or regenerate the opening with more lyrics / a shorter duration.\n"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
 ],
